          ],
          "when": "At most once, the key two to four words, exactly as said, word for word [modes]. Only on a single-crop moment (a solo stretch); on a split there is no free space that isn't a face."
        }
      },
      "cutaway": {
        "kind": "broll",
        "about": "A full-frame cutaway when someone describes a thing there is footage of; both voices carry on.",
